Mette-Marit, the Crown Princess of Norway, is a member of the Norwegian royal family. She is married to HRH Crown Prince Haakon, the heir apparent to the Norwegian throne. <\/p>","link_label":"","link":"","landing_page_url":"","title_button":"Test","url_button":"\/"}},"293c6ecb-94f0-4fef-9570-a879d0f9c12f":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ourcollectors_6.jpg","title":"Lewis Hamilton","text":"<p>Sir Lewis Hamilton is a British Formula One racing driver who has won seven World-Drivers’ Championship titles and holds the records for the most pole positions, podium finishes and wins.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":"","landing_page_url":"","title_button":"Test","url_button":"\/"}},"f88d8d61-ced3-45c3-9394-e04450be4ecf":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ourcollectors_7.jpg","title":"Diane von Furstenberg","text":"<p>Diane von Furstenberg is a Belgian fashion designer best known for her signature wrap dress worn by many celebrities and socialites including Catherine - Princess of Wales, Michelle Obama, Madonna or Whitney Houston. <\/p>","link_label":"","link":"","landing_page_url":"","title_button":"Test","url_button":"\/"}}},"block_order":["column_Wcz67H","template--19747420373328__95ebf3d5-37be-4d10-a0d8-9d371ff32163-column-1","template--19747420373328__95ebf3d5-37be-4d10-a0d8-9d371ff32163-column-2","293c6ecb-94f0-4fef-9570-a879d0f9c12f","f88d8d61-ced3-45c3-9394-e04450be4ecf"],"custom_css":[".multicolumn-card__image-wrapper a {pointer-events: none;}",".multicolumn-card__image-wrapper a img {transform: scale(1); max-width: 100%; height: auto;}",".button.button--primary {display: none;}"],"settings":{"title":"","heading_size":"h2","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"portrait","columns_desktop":2,"column_alignment":"center","background_style":"none","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":12}},"b833ab45-18d0-4c95-b3a3-0777cfc212b